  "invariants": [
    "Workflow state is committed by deterministic handlers; models cannot commit transitions or human approvals.",
    "Founder approval precedes lawyer review request and lawyer approval.",
    "Both approvals bind the same immutable review bundle, including content/base/context/evidence/assessment/validation/harness references.",
    "Material draft, context, evidence, assessment or base changes invalidate both approval gates and force validation then founder review.",
    "Email delivery never grants approval or finalizes a workflow.",
    "Only one workflow owns the document's active proposal slot; the slot persists across human waits.",
    "Every state update compares expected state_version and increments it; claimed worker writes additionally compare a fencing token.",
    "Persisted events and jobs are authoritative; change streams are optional wakeups.",
